    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "正负数的乘法满足交换律：",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 120,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0129#7"
      ],
      "source_text": "正负数的乘法满足交换律：",
      "changes": [],
      "numeric_changes": [],
      "historical_entities": []
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "等式$ab=ba$对于任意数$a$和$b$都是正确的.",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 120,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0129#8"
      ],
      "source_text": "等式$ab=ba$对于任意数$a$和$b$都是正确的.",
      "changes": [],
      "numeric_changes": [],
      "historical_entities": []
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "正数的乘法交换律是早已确定了的.在一个或两个因数是负数的情况下，交换律仍然成立.例如：",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 120,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0129#9"
      ],
      "source_text": "正数的乘法交换律是早已确定了的.在一个或两个因数是负数的情况下，交换律仍然成立.例如：",
      "changes": [],
      "numeric_changes": [],
      "historical_entities": []
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "因为$(-6)\\cdot1.2=-7.2$，$1.2\\cdot(-6)=-7.2$，所以$(-6)\\cdot1.2$ $=1.2\\cdot(-6)$；",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 120,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0129#10",
        "p0130#1"
      ],
      "source_text": "因为$(-6)\\cdot1.2=-7.2$，$1.2\\cdot(-6)=-7.2$，所以$(-6)\\cdot1.2$ $=1.2\\cdot(-6)$；",
      "changes": [],
      "numeric_changes": [],
      "historical_entities": []
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "因为$(-4.5)\\cdot(-2)=9$，$(-2)\\cdot(-4.5)=9$，所以$(-4.5)\\cdot(-2)=(-2)\\cdot(-4.5)$.",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 121,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0130#2"
      ],
      "source_text": "因为$(-4.5)\\cdot(-2)=9$，$(-2)\\cdot(-4.5)=9$，所以$(-4.5)\\cdot(-2)=(-2)\\cdot(-4.5)$.",
      "changes": [],
      "numeric_changes": [],
      "historical_entities": []
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "当一个或两个因数等于零时，乘法交换律仍然成立.",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 121,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0130#3"
      ],
      "source_text": "当一个或两个因数等于零时，乘法交换律仍然成立.",
      "changes": [],
      "numeric_changes": [],
      "historical_entities": []
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "正负数乘法也满足结合律：",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 121,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0130#4"
      ],
      "source_text": "正负数乘法也满足结合律：",
      "changes": [],
      "numeric_changes": [],
      "historical_entities": []
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "对于任意数$a,b$和$c$，等式$(ab)c=a(bc)$成立.",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 121,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0130#5"
      ],
      "source_text": "对于任意数$a,b$和$c$，等式$(ab)c=a(bc)$成立.",
      "changes": [],
      "numeric_changes": [],
      "historical_entities": []
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "我们设$a=-3,b=-5,c=6$，来验证等式$(ab)c=a(bc)$.因为$-3\\cdot(-5)=15$，$15\\cdot6=90$，所以$(ab)c=90$；\n因为$-5\\cdot6=-30$，而$(-3)\\cdot(-30)=90$，所以$a(bc)$也等于90.",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 121,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0130#6"
      ],
      "source_text": "我们设$a=-3,b=-5,c=6$，来验证等式$(ab)c=a(bc)$.因为$-3\\cdot(-5)=15$，$15\\cdot6=90$，所以$(ab)c=90$；因为$-5\\cdot6=-30$，而$(-3)\\cdot(-30)=90$，所以$a(bc)$也等于90.",
      "changes": [
        "layout"
      ],
      "numeric_changes": [],
      "historical_entities": []
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "当几个因数甚至全部因数等于零时，结合律仍然成立.",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 121,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0130#7"
      ],
      "source_text": "当几个因数甚至全部因数等于零时，结合律仍然成立.",
      "changes": [],
      "numeric_changes": [],
      "historical_entities": []
    }
  ],
